. 클리-ÖI언트 호스트는 가꿈 혹은 항상 거져 있을 수 있다. 고전적인 예는","words":[{"text":"청을","x":569,"y":698,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"받는다.","x":650,"y":698,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"클리-ÖI언트","x":776,"y":700,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"호스트는","x":959,"y":701,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"가꿈","x":1109,"y":699,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"혹은","x":1188,"y":701,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"항상","x":1270,"y":701,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"거져","x":1354,"y":701,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"있을","x":1436,"y":702,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1516,"y":703,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1567,"y":703,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"고전적인","x":1656,"y":703,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"예는","x":1805,"y":706,"width":59,"height":44}]},{"text":"클라이언트 호스트에서 실행되는 브라우저가 항상 켜진 웹 서버로 서비스를 요청하는","words":[{"text":"클라이언트","x":566,"y":759,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"호스트에서","x":750,"y":761,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"실행되는","x":935,"y":760,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"브라우저가","x":1081,"y":761,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"항상","x":1263,"y":762,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"켜진","x":1346,"y":763,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"웹","x":1426,"y":763,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"서버로","x":1474,"y":764,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"서비스를","x":1589,"y":764,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"요청하는","x":1737,"y":765,"width":127,"height":46}]},{"text":"웹 애플리케이션이다. 웹 서버가 클리이언트 호스트로부터 객체를 요청받으면 웹 서버","words":[{"text":"웹","x":567,"y":819,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션이다.","x":613,"y":820,"width":277,"height":39},{"text":"웹","x":907,"y":822,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"서버가","x":953,"y":822,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"클리이언트","x":1065,"y":822,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"호스트로부터","x":1245,"y":824,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"객체를","x":1464,"y":825,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"요청받으면","x":1576,"y":825,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"웹","x":1759,"y":826,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"서버","x":1803,"y":829,"width":5